      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/narad_linkml/schema/narad/is_instance_of",
      "description": "NARAD alias for rdf:type. Links a facility-specific instance node to the LinkML class or semantic class it instantiates. In the graph this edge is labelled narad:isInstanceOf. Values are typically the rdf:type of the Class that implements the signal binding.\n",
